From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TurboVadim <yolkin.vadim@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 23:45:12 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Restore Paper brain activity iteration order

Cache behavior sets in Paper priority and HashMap activity order for starts,
ticks and stops. Check live activity membership once per set so changes made
by an earlier behavior take effect in the same tick without allocating.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/entity/ai/Brain.java b/net/minecraft/world/entity/ai/Brain.java
index f576a0a1956e426f7601dc73bd3c13fe3e9e992d..079840e1a396d45d62448e34e78a3ad5b7ef77a6 100644
